WEBVTT

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.096
is that players love making stuff.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.296
When they were able
to make stuff in the game,

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.537
they had a lot of empathy
in connection to it.

00:04:05.561 --> 00:04:07.237
Even if it wasn't as pretty

00:04:07.261 --> 00:04:09.952
as a professional artist
would make for games,

00:04:09.976 --> 00:04:11.193
it really stuck with them

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:13.674
and they really cared
about what would happen to it.

00:04:13.698 --> 00:04:17.128
At this point, we've left the water,
and now with this little creature --

00:04:17.152 --> 00:04:19.222
we could bring up
the volume a little bit --

00:04:19.246 --> 00:04:21.182
and now we might try to eat.

00:04:21.814 --> 00:04:24.299
We might sneak up
on this little guy over here maybe,

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.280
and try and eat him.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.376
OK, well, we fight.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.800
(Creatures grunting)